.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

# Heavy data — never ship to Cloud Run (with surgical re-includes below).
# pipeline/ + control/ + scripts/ + web/ are intentionally INCLUDED in
# the build context here because the FastAPI image's Dockerfile COPYs
# them. (`data/*` rather than `data/` so the !exceptions further down
# can re-include the small mirrored-asset subdirs.)
data/*
workers/
sources/
agent/
shared/
tests/
docs/

# Re-include the mirrored channel-asset subdir (avatars/banners) so
# /api/channels surfaces real channel faces. cloud/web-server/Dockerfile
# COPYs that explicitly. data/* (with wildcard) above keeps the parent
# dir visible so this re-include works — gitignore semantics forbid
# re-including children of an excluded dir.
#
# data/research/youtube/ + data/research/analytics/ are NOT re-included
# any more (B2 of the 2026-05-10 token-issue fix). Live dashboard stats
# come from YouTube Data API v3 with YOUTUBE_API_KEY (no on-disk
# cache); per-account research cache lives in gs://...-state.
!data/research/
data/research/*
!data/research/channel_assets/
!data/research/channel_assets/**

# Central music bed assets (~2 MB). render-worker-v2's Dockerfile
# COPYs data/music/ into the image so every channel's
# music_bed_default (ambient_low, cinematic, dreamy, …) resolves at
# render time. Without this re-include, the build fails with
# "COPY failed: stat data/music/: file does not exist" — which is
# exactly the F24 Dockerfile-COPY-drift class manifesting through
# .dockerignore instead of the Dockerfile itself.
!data/music/
!data/music/**

# Per-channel folders: cloud control plane needs config.yaml + variants/
# + uploads/ + raw/ + narrations/ (the last two so the round-robin
# scheduler can see the backlog). Everything heavy stays out.
**/cache/
**/scratch/
**/footage/
**/emoji/
**/cooking_loops/
**/tts_tests/
**/cooking_bg_queue.yaml
**/branding/
**/shorts/
**/learnings/
**/cast/
**/prompts/
**/dossier/
**/shotlist/
**/specs/
**/critiques/
**/songs/
*/scripts/
*/SHIPPED.md

# Models
*.onnx
*.bin
*.safetensors

# Old docs
*.md
!README.md
